          {"id": "D", "text": "I: $(\\frac y2-10)(\\frac{y^2}4+5y+100)$\n\nII: $(x+\\frac13)(x^2-\\frac x3+\\frac19)$\n\nIII: $(4x+\\frac y3)(16x^2-\\frac{4xy}9+\\frac{y^2}9)$", "figure_ids": []}
