    {
      "id": "n20-factor-decimal-bases",
      "source_numbers": ["311"],
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "Treat the terminating decimals as exact numbers. Factor:\n\nI. $c^3-0.001$\n\nII. $0.008b^3+125$\n\nIII. $0.064-n^3y^3$\n\nWhich list gives all three factorizations?",
