        "stem": "Reduce the four expressions over the real numbers, retaining every exclusion from the original denominator:\n\nI. $\\frac{y^3-1000}{y-10}$\n\nII. $\\frac{8x^3+27}{6x+9}$\n\nIII. $\\frac{a^2+6a+36}{a^3-216}$\n\nIV. $\\frac{18b^2+24b+32}{27b^3-64}$\n\nWhich list gives all reduced forms and original domains?",
