      "intent": {
        "task": "Combine the two original two-term expressions and retain original excluded inputs.",
        "source_solution": "For U put S=p^2+pq+q^2. Common numerator S-3pq=(p-q)^2; cancel one p-q to obtain (p-q)/S, p!=q. For V put T=a^2-2a+4; numerator 6a^3+12a-3a^2(a+2)=3aT, giving 3a/(a+2), a!=-2. S vanishes only at (0,0) and T>0.",
